{"page":323,"width":1664,"height":2352,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"[그림 9-이 히프트리에서의 삽입연산은 신입사원을 일단 말단자리에 앉힌 다음. 능력에 따라 승진시카는 것과 유사하다.","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":142,"y":824,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"9-이","x":205,"y":823,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"히프트리에서의","x":276,"y":826,"width":148,"height":24},{"text":"삽입연산은","x":433,"y":826,"width":103,"height":25},{"text":"신입사원을","x":544,"y":827,"width":102,"height":24},{"text":"일단","x":654,"y":827,"width":40,"height":24},{"text":"말단자리에","x":702,"y":826,"width":102,"height":25},{"text":"앉힌","x":812,"y":826,"width":40,"height":24},{"text":"다음.","x":861,"y":827,"width":44,"height":24},{"text":"능력에","x":913,"y":827,"width":61,"height":24},{"text":"따라","x":984,"y":827,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"승진시카는","x":1032,"y":825,"width":105,"height":26},{"text":"것과","x":1145,"y":825,"width":43,"height":25},{"text":"유사하다.","x":1194,"y":825,"width":91,"height":25}]},{"text":"히프에 새로운 요소가 들어오면, 일단 새로운 노드를 히프의 마지막 노뜨로 삽입된다. 마지막","words":[{"text":"히프에","x":175,"y":930,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"새로운","x":268,"y":931,"width":83,"height":30},{"text":"요소가","x":361,"y":931,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"들어오면,","x":453,"y":932,"width":111,"height":31},{"text":"일단","x":580,"y":931,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"새로운","x":640,"y":931,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"노드를","x":728,"y":932,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"히프의","x":818,"y":931,"width":75,"height":31},{"text":"마지막","x":906,"y":931,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"노뜨로","x":995,"y":933,"width":80,"height":23},{"text":"삽입된다.","x":1085,"y":930,"width":115,"height":30},{"text":"마지막","x":1215,"y":930,"width":83,"height":32}]},{"text":"1「亡 다음에 새로운 노드를 위지시기면 히프트리의 성질이 만족되지 않을 수 있다 따라서 삽입","words":[{"text":"1「亡","x":147,"y":987,"width":47,"height":22},{"text":"다음에","x":209,"y":984,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"새로운","x":304,"y":984,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"노드를","x":396,"y":985,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"위지시기면","x":488,"y":984,"width":128,"height":32},{"tex